The City of Rovaniemi aims to strengthen sled parking operations in the Friendship Park, located next to Hotel Pohjanhovi.
The City Board decided on Monday that a town plan proposal for the Friendship Park park and its surrounding area will be publicly displayed at a service point in Osvitta.
